WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:08.090
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:34.100
For the legendary cookware,

00:01:34.390 --> 00:01:36.430
Lei En and I had the extended battle.

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:39.240
He used his dark kitchen knife,

00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:41.470
the North Star Sirius Blade,

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:44.390
making the Frozen Ice Bream Mountain.

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:47.050
But I won't lose to him.

00:01:47.490 --> 00:01:49.790
I made a third knife with steel wire

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:51.340
and Hundred-Hole Knife,

00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:54.240
for the specialty: Reincarnation Spring Rolls.

00:01:54.970 --> 00:01:57.060
Now, the result is

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:58.050
about to be announced.

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:01.570
Now I am announcing

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:04.480
the winner of the

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:05.920
Knife Skills Contest is,

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:13.260
Super Chef, Liu Maoxing.

00:02:16.170 --> 00:02:18.850
Great!

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:24.270
Legendary Cooking Utensil!
The Secret of the Forever-Spirit Knife!

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:27.430
Bravo!

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:32.940
Why?

00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:35.070
In this extended contest,

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:37.140
it's a head-on battle

00:02:37.180 --> 00:02:39.210
between two souls,

00:02:39.560 --> 00:02:41.180
which well fits

00:02:41.230 --> 00:02:42.920
the spirit of this contest.

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:44.210
However,

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:45.250
from the work that Mao

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:47.610
made the bream into spring rolls,

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:48.970
we saw

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:51.240
his incredible creativity,

00:02:51.460 --> 00:02:52.270
as well as the possibilities

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:54.550
that he shows in Chinese cooking.

00:02:55.350 --> 00:02:57.070
You are excellent, Mao.

00:02:57.900 --> 00:02:59.710
Yes, thank you very much.

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:07.120
Before the true heir appears,

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:10.840
the legendary cookware dormant in Daxian Temple,

00:03:11.590 --> 00:03:14.480
given Liu Maoxing's excellent performance

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:17.140
in the battle,

00:03:17.190 --> 00:03:18.770
the Super Chef from Guangdong,

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:20.260
he is qualified

00:03:20.310 --> 00:03:22.220
for the cookware inheritance ritual.

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:24.850
Inheritance ritual?

00:03:25.310 --> 00:03:26.030
Does it mean

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:27.880
he has to do something else?

00:03:28.230 --> 00:03:28.790
Yes.

00:03:29.530 --> 00:03:30.970
He's not yet

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:32.540
the official owner of the cookware.

00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:36.140
He must go through a ritual

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:38.100
to prove if he is the true heir.

00:03:44.770 --> 00:03:47.450
Liu Maoxing, please come with me.

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:48.240
Yes.

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:53.930
The Legendary Cookware.

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:57.660
A thousand years ago,

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:08.480
it was crafted by a legendary chef, Shuri,

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:10.490
with a meteor

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:13.660
falling from the universe.

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:15.960
Unveil the legendary cookware!

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:33.520
What?

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:44.860
That's it!

00:04:45.170 --> 00:04:47.080
The craft of Shuri.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:50.290
The legendary cookware, Forever-Spirit Knife!

00:04:51.960 --> 00:04:53.190
There is no rust at all!

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:54.980
But it looks like

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:56.380
an ordinary kitchen knife.

00:04:56.710 --> 00:04:59.210
Go ahead. Take it and have a look.

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:00.410
Yes.

00:05:04.140 --> 00:05:05.990
Dad, the ritual you said,

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:06.730
when will it begin?

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:08.100
It's already begun.

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:11.190
When he holds it

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:12.170
in his hand,

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:14.110
the knife will judge

00:05:14.690 --> 00:05:17.160
if he is the true heir.

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:25.450
However,

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:27.470
nothing special has happened.

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:48.370
Look.

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:51.510
Something emerged on the knife!

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:52.710
What's it?

00:05:58.930 --> 00:06:01.080
Good. The Forever-Spirit Knife

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:03.140
recognized you as the true heir.

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:05.220
After 400 years,

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:07.860
the dragon pattern emerged on the knife.

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:10.680
That is exactly the proof.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:14.320
You are the true heir

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:17.010
of the legendary Forever-Spirit Knife.

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:18.810
You are awesome!

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:20.680
Awesome! Meili! Silang!

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:21.530
Chef Xie!

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:23.280
You are modest.

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:24.810
You are the person who is awesome.

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:26.280
That's right.

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:29.570
I never thought I could see

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:30.690
the reappearance of the dragon pattern alive.

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:34.880
Master Luo Wu,

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:35.920
can I use

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:37.380
this Forever-Spirit Knife?

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:43.560
The Legendary Cookware.

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:45.200
I wonder how it works.

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:48.030
He is really holding it.

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:50.480
But that's the leftover bream.

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:52.600
It's been a long time.

00:06:52.650 --> 00:06:53.920
The taste has changed.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:02.640
It is...

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:04.980
It's amazing.

00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:06.170
Feels like

00:07:06.450 --> 00:07:08.690
the knife is cutting with consciousness.

00:07:15.970 --> 00:07:17.810
How is the taste of the bream

00:07:18.590 --> 00:07:19.320
cut by the legendary cookware?

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:29.840
It recovered!

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:31.200
The bream

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:32.830
has expired,

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:34.590
but now it has recovered.

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:36.170
How is that possible?

00:07:36.210 --> 00:07:37.920
Just as the legend said,

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:39.990
it can recover the taste

00:07:40.110 --> 00:07:41.940
that has lost.

00:07:42.280 --> 00:07:44.490
That’s the mysterious power!

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:48.110
Mao, don't doubt yourself.

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:50.050
You are the true heir

00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:51.400
chosen by gods.

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:52.990
Bravo!

00:07:56.090 --> 00:07:58.540
But there should be another heir.

00:07:58.940 --> 00:07:59.640
Lei En.

00:08:04.890 --> 00:08:06.580
Boy, what else do you want?

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:08.370
This knife is great.

00:08:08.850 --> 00:08:10.360
I want you to try it, too.

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:12.560
Wh... What?

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:16.060
Why is he doing that?

00:08:16.110 --> 00:08:17.800
Wait! You can't!

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:20.350
He's from the Dark Cooking Society.

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:21.580
How can you let him touch it?

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:23.220
Yes! That's absolutely right!

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:24.910
Do not let him touch it!

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:26.010
Right! He can't!

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:27.070
Yes.

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:28.030
He did use the techniques

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:29.260
of the Dark Cooking Society.

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:31.030
But he's willing to sacrifice himself

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:32.520
for good food.

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:33.300
His willpower,

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:35.430
the kindness

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:36.480
of praying for ingredients.

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:38.300
The Dark Cooking Society

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:39.510
is supposed to bring misfortune to people.

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:43.210
But from the food he made,

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:44.310
I didn't see

00:08:44.360 --> 00:08:45.900
anything harmful to people.

00:08:46.030 --> 00:08:47.700
Mao.

00:08:48.940 --> 00:08:50.110
Take it. Lei En.

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:50.840
Fool!

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:52.840
What if he attacks you?

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:54.230
Stop it, Mao!

00:08:54.520 --> 00:08:55.520
No!

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:57.980
Don't!

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:01.950
Don't!

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:15.530
How is it possible?

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:16.650
When Lei En held the knife,

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:19.710
the heir-proving dragon pattern appeared too!

00:09:20.380 --> 00:09:21.440
Unbelievable.

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:23.660
The Forever-spirit Knife also

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:25.390
recognized the loser Lei En as the heir.

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:28.010
Just as I thought.

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:29.070
The Forever-Spirit Knife

00:09:29.110 --> 00:09:30.710
proved it for me.

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:32.110
Prove?

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:33.440
Do you mean Lei En...

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:35.530
He isn't from the Dark Cooking Society!

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:37.260
Don't be cheated by him!

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:38.760
Look, everyone!

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:40.920
The tattoo on his hand!

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:44.250
He is the guy from the Dark Cooking Society

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:45.990
who took my Steel Staff!

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:48.110
Yes, you are too careless!

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:53.390
Lei En, would you tell me the truth?

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:58.630
You are an incredible guy.

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:01.660
You might understand me

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:03.780
as a childhood genius.

00:10:04.560 --> 00:10:05.260
After I finished studying

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:07.680
in Yang Spring Restaurant,

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:09.690
to broaden my horizon,

00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:10.940
I embarked on a journey of study.

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:14.760
But I couldn’t find anything to learn.

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:17.240
In pursuit of self-perfection,

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:19.100
I entered the forbidden gate

00:10:19.150 --> 00:10:21.130
of the Dark Cooking Society.

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:23.240
To join them,

00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:24.210
I had to take the tattoo

00:10:24.260 --> 00:10:25.540
that would never disappear.

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:27.830
Then the strict training begun.

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:30.890
You could never imagine

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:33.220
how strict it was.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:38.160
But I was very happy.

00:10:39.440 --> 00:10:41.190
It made me feel excited.

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:44.290
I know that feeling.

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:47.090
I learned the dark techniques,

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:48.680
and became complacent.

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:49.620
And at that time,

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:51.350
I made another

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:53.900
unforgivable mistake.

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:56.520
Unforgivable as a chef,

00:10:56.560 --> 00:11:00.210
no, even as a human.

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:02.040
At that time,

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:03.950
I finally knew the true color of the Society.

00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:05.960
And I felt great fear.

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:08.490
So I ran away, risking my life.

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:10.760
The thing made me betray them

00:11:11.300 --> 00:11:13.220
was to get the legendary cookware

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:14.420
that Master Luo Wu

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:15.390
promised me.

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:19.400
I...

00:11:24.380 --> 00:11:27.790
I came back to fight against the Dark Cooking Society!

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:34.020
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:35.860 --> 00:11:36.610
Everyone.

00:11:37.140 --> 00:11:38.360
This banquet is for Mao and Lei En

00:11:38.410 --> 00:11:41.630
to show the Forever-Spirit Knife.

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:42.990
Now it begins.

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:46.280
Please enjoy the delicious food.

00:11:47.690 --> 00:11:49.970
The first dish is Mao's cooking.

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:52.190
Mao, come on!

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:03.540
That's the dragon pattern.

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:05.030
I'm wondering

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:06.750
how the food tastes

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:08.200
cooked with Forever-Spirit Knife.

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:09.690
I can't wait to try it.

00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:13.550
Okay, let's begin.

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:19.010
Silang, serve the dishes

00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:20.260
before they get cold.

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:22.520
I know.

00:12:22.620 --> 00:12:24.620
The Super Chef's Bream Continental Seal

00:12:24.750 --> 00:12:26.110
and Reincarnation Spring Rolls.

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:30.720
This is delicious!

00:12:30.880 --> 00:12:32.960
Is this the food he cooked

00:12:33.010 --> 00:12:34.580
in the Knife Skills Competition?

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:36.150
He is awesome,

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:37.720
the youngest Super Chef

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:39.150
in history!

00:12:40.770 --> 00:12:42.740
It's said Forever-Spirit Knife sees

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:45.520
every ongoing Knife Skills Competition.

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:46.470
At that time,

00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:49.190
he gave it to Lei En.

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:52.590
That means he had found it out.

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:53.340
That's to say,

00:12:53.780 --> 00:12:55.110
the Knife Skills Competition

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:56.830
is not only about techniques,

00:12:57.390 --> 00:12:59.030
but also about knowing people.

00:13:00.680 --> 00:13:01.810
He's really awesome.

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:05.810
If it wasn't Lei En,

00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:08.450
where did my steel staff go?

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:11.560
As agreed, I'll take it away.

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:12.980
Does this mean

00:13:13.030 --> 00:13:14.520
some guys from the Dark Cooking Society

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:16.670
have come to Guangzhou?

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:20.960
Everyone. Next,

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:22.630
besides Mao,

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:24.880
after 400 years,

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:28.640
another heir appears, Lei En!

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:29.440
Now, after Mao,

00:13:29.520 --> 00:13:31.600
he'll show his skill with the Forever-Spirit Knife!

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:34.650
That is the genius chef, Lei En,

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:36.970
who tied with Mao.

00:13:37.260 --> 00:13:39.030
I can't wait for his cooking, too.

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:42.980
Okay, it's your turn now.

00:13:48.530 --> 00:13:49.990
The dragon pattern disappears!

00:13:50.110 --> 00:13:51.160
What's going on?

00:13:53.170 --> 00:13:54.050
No... It's wrong!

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:55.810
You are not Lei En!

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:57.430
What did you say?

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:03.180
You bastard!

00:14:11.350 --> 00:14:12.750
I made it.

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:13.670
The Forever-Spirit Knife

00:14:13.690 --> 00:14:16.640
now belongs to the Dark Cooking Society.

00:14:17.650 --> 00:14:18.540
That's mine!

00:14:18.910 --> 00:14:20.250
You finally show up.

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:21.950
You scrum from the Dark Cooking Society!

00:14:27.530 --> 00:14:29.130
Don't underestimate me.

00:14:30.750 --> 00:14:31.510
What?

00:14:39.030 --> 00:14:39.720
Stop there!

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:47.730
Idiots. I've got the Forever-Spirit Knife.

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:49.020
I have no more business here.

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:52.740
You don't. But I do.

00:14:57.550 --> 00:14:58.160
Lei En.

00:14:58.640 --> 00:15:00.380
No matter how filthy your tricks are,

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:02.220
you will not have your way.

00:15:02.690 --> 00:15:04.060
Damn it!

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:07.170
Stop him!

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:17.040
Are you all right, Lei En?

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:18.790
I'm fine. Just a scratch.

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:21.860
Give us the Forever-Spirit Knife.

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:24.980
Have you forgotten

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:27.070
I'm from the Dark Cooking Society?

00:15:27.310 --> 00:15:28.320
Watch carefully.

00:15:28.430 --> 00:15:30.310
See how we get things done.

00:15:31.040 --> 00:15:31.510
No!

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:39.920
Why?

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:49.600
You know it, don't you?

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:50.960
If the Forever-Spirit Knife

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:53.670
is used for other purposes,

00:15:53.990 --> 00:15:55.370
its mysterious power

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:02.790
will disappear.

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:04.150
You bastard!

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:06.490
What... What's happening?

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:08.200
No!

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:13.850
Don't look down on us.

00:16:14.470 --> 00:16:15.900
This is just beginning.

00:16:16.390 --> 00:16:18.320
Today it is the first step

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:21.610
of our great ambition.

00:16:28.220 --> 00:16:29.250
It goes like this

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:30.790
before we can see the mysterious power

00:16:30.830 --> 00:16:31.940
of the Forever-Spirit Knife.

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:33.660
Mao.

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:35.170
Seppuku.

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:36.680
My mom ever told me

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:38.760
about the Japanese samurai's suicide.

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:42.680
The Dark Cooking Society is horrible.

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:45.890
Since the Dark Cooking Society has acted,

00:16:46.450 --> 00:16:47.460
the secret of the legendary cookware

00:16:47.510 --> 00:16:50.040
should be revealed.

00:16:50.930 --> 00:16:51.610
Secret?

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:53.370
Master Luo Wu.

00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:55.820
What is the secret you said?

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:57.890
Okay. Listen up.

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:59.730
Guangzhou's Forever-Spirit Knife

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:02.130
is just one of the legendary cookware.

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:03.230
One of them?

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:05.320
Do you mean there are others?

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:06.340
Yes.

00:17:06.680 --> 00:17:08.950
There are eight legendary pieces.

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:11.680
It's said they are scattered

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:12.660
at eight places

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:14.680
in China,

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:18.150
protecting Chinese cooking world.

00:17:20.910 --> 00:17:22.500
Eight pieces of cookware.

00:17:23.820 --> 00:17:26.870
Seven more powerful pieces like this!

00:17:27.820 --> 00:17:30.060
The legend says that

00:17:30.530 --> 00:17:32.910
Chef Shuri forged 8 cookware

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:34.760
with a meteorite from sky.

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:38.850
But they were too powerful.

00:17:39.220 --> 00:17:39.980
To avoid conflicts

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:40.920
among the cookware,

00:17:41.190 --> 00:17:43.430
they were sealed in eight places in China.

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:50.720
The legendary cookware is like double-edged sword.

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:51.990
You are right.

00:17:52.390 --> 00:17:54.130
If a good chef uses it,

00:17:54.320 --> 00:17:56.200
it will have great effect.

00:17:56.910 --> 00:17:59.940
But if the Dark Cooking Society

00:17:59.990 --> 00:18:01.060
uses them for evil,

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:03.670
not only Chinese cooking,

00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:05.210
all the people

00:18:05.260 --> 00:18:06.640
will suffer in their hands.

00:18:07.280 --> 00:18:08.950
Before they take them,

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:11.050
it's time for us

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:13.030
to find

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:14.190
the cookware.

00:18:15.800 --> 00:18:17.480
Master Luo Wu. Chef Zhou Yu.

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:21.590
Please let me collect

00:18:22.150 --> 00:18:23.340
the legendary cookware!

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:25.630
My mother

00:18:25.880 --> 00:18:27.400
had a long fight

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:28.550
with the Dark Cooking Society,

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:30.290
for people's happiness.

00:18:31.060 --> 00:18:32.700
This is also my mother's wish.

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:34.370
Please allow me to go!

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:35.500
Mao.

00:18:35.770 --> 00:18:36.470
Mao.

00:18:37.780 --> 00:18:38.710
Hold on.

00:18:41.750 --> 00:18:43.570
Chef Xie. Lei En.

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:44.800
Let me join you

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:46.360
in this journey.

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:48.530
Eliminating the Dark Cooking Society

00:18:48.900 --> 00:18:50.550
is also my aim of life.

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:52.770
This will be fun.

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:54.960
How can I let you enjoy it alone?

00:18:56.090 --> 00:18:57.850
Mao. Lei En and Chef Xie.

00:18:58.490 --> 00:19:01.230
They are reliable friends.

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:03.100
Old man, I'm going too.

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:04.130
I'm going as well.

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:06.300
Can I go with them? Please!

00:19:06.570 --> 00:19:07.130
Silang.

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:09.140
Stay here and help in the restaurant.

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:13.150
Meili. It's too dangerous.

00:19:13.690 --> 00:19:15.650
This trip is not the same as before.

00:19:15.970 --> 00:19:16.870
Father.

00:19:17.690 --> 00:19:19.300
Meili. Silang.

00:19:24.270 --> 00:19:24.980
Listen.

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:27.530
You must return safely

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:28.730
to Guangzhou.

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:30.930
Yes. We are leaving.

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:33.460
Take good care of yourself.

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:34.580
Good luck.

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:36.760
Long live Liu Maoxing!

00:19:39.520 --> 00:19:41.750
The continent's best Super Dim Sum Chef,

00:19:42.210 --> 00:19:43.290
\"Steal Bar Xie”.

00:19:43.640 --> 00:19:44.490
With dark techniques,

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:47.190
the young knife superman,

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:48.620
Seven Star Knives, Lei En.

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:49.690
And,

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:51.120
inside the small body, he has

00:19:51.170 --> 00:19:54.670
the extraordinary gift and the soul of chef.

00:19:55.100 --> 00:19:57.410
Super Chef, Liu Maoxing.

00:19:58.010 --> 00:19:59.270
Long live!

00:19:59.390 --> 00:20:00.770
Young fighters.

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:03.520
Hey.

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:04.070
Ouch.

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:05.730
It's the day we set off.

00:20:05.820 --> 00:20:07.150
Don't wear such a look.

00:20:08.070 --> 00:20:08.590
Speaking of that,

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:10.890
Meili and Silang didn't come to say goodbye.

00:20:12.010 --> 00:20:14.690
Maybe they don't want to see us leave.

00:20:15.330 --> 00:20:16.070
Fine.

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:28.670
Annoying! Stop it!

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:30.340
What are you doing?

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:50.520
Meili! Silang!

00:20:51.720 --> 00:20:52.930
Mao!

00:20:53.450 --> 00:20:54.440
Mao!

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:56.480
What are you doing?

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:58.920
Chef Zhou Yu finally agreed

00:20:59.310 --> 00:21:01.060
to let us go with you!

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:02.830
Is it true, Meili?

00:21:04.220 --> 00:21:04.830
Yes.

00:21:05.100 --> 00:21:05.870
Great.

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:07.310
You will join us!

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:09.310
Mao.

00:21:10.420 --> 00:21:11.390
Meili.

00:21:14.220 --> 00:21:14.850
Don't do that

00:21:14.900 --> 00:21:17.200
so early in the morning.

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:19.360
Your face blushes

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:20.850
like a boiled shrimp.

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:23.650
Boiled shrimp.

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:24.880
That's funny.

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:28.750
Silang. Freeze!

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:29.420
By the way,

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:32.230
did you agree them to go?

00:21:32.320 --> 00:21:34.640
Are you so soft now?

00:21:34.840 --> 00:21:35.760
Who said that?

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:37.580
I didn't agree anything.

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:40.010
Never mind.

00:21:40.300 --> 00:21:42.490
Nobody can stop them.

00:21:44.420 --> 00:21:46.310
Stop there, Silang!

00:21:46.430 --> 00:21:49.420
I'm no fool!

00:23:15.050 --> 00:23:17.840
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.840 --> 00:23:20.079
Wow, so this is Shanghai!

00:23:20.542 --> 00:23:22.427
It was our first time to see the city of Shanghai,

00:23:22.427 --> 00:23:24.296
and we were hooked,

00:23:24.296 --> 00:23:27.825
without knowing that the horrifying trap of
the Dark Cooking Society is waiting.

00:23:27.825 --> 00:23:29.287
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.798 --> 00:23:30.805
Magical City Shanghai!

00:23:31.117 --> 00:23:32.676
The Underworld's Declaration of War!

00:23:33.094 --> 00:23:34.570
It will definitely be interesting!
